alue":"Arc sine of r, in radians."},"sortText":"2asin"},{"label":"atan","kind":3,"detail":"atan(r1,r2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"R1, r2 in radians; if r2 is present, produces atan2(r1,r2)."},"sortText":"2atan"},{"label":"bal","kind":3,"detail":"bal(c1,c2,c3,s,i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generates the sequence of integer positions in s up to a character of c1 in s[i1:i2] that is balanced with respect to characters in c2 and c3, but fails if there is no such position."},"sortText":"2bal"},{"label":"bytes","kind":3,"detail":"bytes(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Relabel a string as bytes; or the bytes matching a cset"},"sortText":"2bytes"},{"label":"center","kind":3,"detail":"center(s1,i,s2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Pad s1 on left and right with s2 to length i."},"sortText":"2center"},{"label":"char","kind":3,"detail":"char(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Produce a string consisting of character i."},"sortText":"2char"},{"label":"chdir","kind":3,"detail":"chdir(s)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Change working directory to s."},"sortText":"2chdir"},{"label":"close","kind":3,"detail":"close(f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Close file f."},"sortText":"2close"},{"label":"collect","kind":3,"detail":"collect(i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Call garbage collector to ensure i2 bytes in region i1. no longer works."},"sortText":"2collect"},{"label":"copy","kind":3,"detail":"copy(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Make a copy of object x."},"sortText":"2copy"},{"label":"cos","kind":3,"detail":"cos(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Cosine of r, r in radians."},"sortText":"2cos"},{"label":"cset","kind":3,"detail":"cset(x)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert x to a cset, failing if that is not possible."},"sortText":"2cset"},{"label":"delay","kind":3,"detail":"delay(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Delay for i milliseconds."},"sortText":"2delay"},{"label":"delete","kind":3,"detail":"delete(x1,x2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Delete element x2 from set or table x1 if it is there (always succeeds and returns x1)."},"sortText":"2delete"},{"label":"detab","kind":3,"detail":"detab(s,i,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Replace tabs with spaces, with stops at columns indicated."},"sortText":"2detab"},{"label":"display","kind":3,"detail":"display(i,f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Display local variables of i most recent procedure activations, plus global variables. Output to file f (default \u0026errout)."},"sortText":"2display"},{"label":"dtor","kind":3,"detail":"dtor(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Convert r from degrees to radians."},"sortText":"2dtor"},{"label":"entab","kind":3,"detail":"entab(s,i,...)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Replace spaces with tabs, with stops at columns indicated."},"sortText":"2entab"},{"label":"errorclear","kind":3,"detail":"errorclear()","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Clear error condition."},"sortText":"2errorclear"},{"label":"exit","kind":3,"detail":"exit(i)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Exit process with status i, which defaults to 0."},"sortText":"2exit"},{"label":"exp","kind":3,"detail":"exp(r)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"E raised to the power r."},"sortText":"2exp"},{"label":"fattrib","kind":3,"detail":"fattrib(str,att)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Get the attribute of a file"},"sortText":"2fattrib"},{"label":"find","kind":3,"detail":"find(s1,s2,i1,i2)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Generates the sequence of positions in s2 at which s1 occurs as a substring in s2[i1:i2], but fails if there is no such position."},"sortText":"2find"},{"label":"flush","kind":3,"detail":"flush(f)","documentation":{"kind":"markdown","value":"Flush file f."},"sortText":"2flush"},{"labe